<i># Dancing to the rhythm #</i>


01:02:08.862 --> 01:02:11.997
<i># Of a love shining so bright #</i>


01:02:13.733 --> 01:02:18.003
<i># I can't take my eyes off you #</i>


01:02:18.004 --> 01:02:21.073
<i># Tell me darling if it's true #</i>


01:02:23.076 --> 01:02:25.044
<i># The skies smile from high above #</i>


01:02:25.045 --> 01:02:28.013
<i># I'm in love #</i>


