<i># Takin' a chance #</i>


01:02:32.452 --> 01:02:36.689
<i># That this restless summer night #</i>


01:02:36.690 --> 01:02:38.457
<i># Gave us a fine romance #</i>


01:02:41.461 --> 01:02:43.095
<i># When you're near me #</i>


01:02:43.096 --> 01:02:47.032
<i># I fall like an evanescent star #</i>


01:02:48.068 --> 01:02:50.769
<i># Smiling from high above #</i>


01:02:50.770 --> 01:02:54.473
<i># I'm in love #</i>


01:02:54.474 --> 01:02:57.376
<i>- Αλλά δυστυχώς ήπιε
